OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWanderers acquire Meadowbank
OL,4,Astadium leasehold
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed transfer of ownership of
OL,7,FMeadowbank Stadium from Surrey County
OL,8,FFootball Association to Dorking
OL,9,FWanderers Football Club has been
OL,10,Fapproved by Mole Valley District
OL,11,FCouncil.
OL,13,FThe Wanderers have played there since
OL,14,F2018 after it was refurbished. It had
OL,15,Fpreviously been home to Dorking FC
OL,16,Fprior to their disbanding.
OL,18,FThe club said it "marks a significant
OL,19,Fmilestone" following several years of
OL,20,Fhard work to reach this point.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
